WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.940 --> 00:00:05.910
So, well, astatine is an element which most
chemists, including me, know

00:00:05.910 --> 00:00:12.150
little about them except its name. In fact
most of our students have

00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:17.660
difficulty even remembering the name. And,
again, like many radioactive

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:24.290
materials, because it’s highly radioactive
not only is the chemistry not

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:29.020
studied much but the compounds themselves
tend to decompose very

00:00:29.020 --> 00:00:29.460
easily.

